# Heartfelt — Supabase Environment Configuration
# If left blank, Heartfelt will run in High-Performance Local Persistent Mode (IndexedDB + LocalStorage)
# To connect your own Supabase project:
# 1. Create a project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Run the SQL schema from supabase/schema.sql in the Supabase SQL Editor
# 3. Create a public storage bucket named "birthday-photos"
# 4. Copy your project URL and anon public key below:

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

